const expLabels=['PROPOSAL WORKSPACE','CAMPAIGN OPERATIONS','ACCOUNT INTELLIGENCE','PERSONA / FOCUS GROUP','FINANCIAL PLANNING','REVENUE WORKSPACE','TEAM & CAPACITY','PROJECT COLLABORATION','BUSINESS INTELLIGENCE','SCENARIO WORKSTATION','INVESTMENT INTELLIGENCE','DELIVERY WORKSPACE',''];
const expMenu=[['Conversation','Document studio','Review & compliance'],['Campaign','Personalized sequences','Approval center'],['Priority inbox','Account intelligence','Routing rules'],['Build a focus group','Panel results','Version comparison'],['Company workbook','Department plan','Review & sign-off'],['Executive overview','Deal workspace','Revenue outlook'],['Capacity planner','Assignment register','Staffing risks'],['Project home','Project plan','Files & discussions','People & access'],['Executive pulse','Report library','Cross-report insights'],['Scenario model','Model assumptions','Compare scenarios'],['Investment model','Evidence register','Sensitivity'],['All initiatives','Delivery timeline','Decisions & risks'],['Company lists','Morning briefing','Research brief']];
function expBrand(i){return `<div class="exp-brand"><span>${icon(expIcons[i])}</span><div><b>${expNames[i]}</b>${expLabels[i]?`<small>${expLabels[i]}</small>`:''}</div></div>`}
function expHeader(i,action='',other=''){return `<div class="exp-top">${expBrand(i)}<div class="exp-links">${expMenu[i].map((x,t)=>btn(x,`tab=${t};render()`,tab===t?'selected':'')).join('')}</div><div class="righttools">${other}${action}</div></div>`}
function localNav(i,extras='',dark=false){return `<div class="exp-localnav ${dark?'dark':''}">${expBrand(i)}<div class="local-label">WORKSPACE</div>${expMenu[i].map((x,t)=>btn(icon(['home','list','spark','user'][t])+x,`tab=${t};render()`,'local-link '+(tab===t?'active':''))).join('')}${extras}<div class="local-bottom">Nine-67<br>Client demonstration workspace</div></div>`}
function secondary(i){return `<div class="secondary-body">${saasViews[i]()}</div>`}
function focusProduct(){state.productFocus=!state.productFocus;document.body.classList.toggle('product-focus',!!state.productFocus);persist()}
render=function(){previousProductRender();document.body.classList.toggle('product-focus',!!state.productFocus);if(current<0)return;document.title=toolsList[current][0]+' · Nine-67';$('#main').innerHTML=[proposalExperience,responseExperience,triageExperience,simulationExperience,budgetExperience,salesExperience,resourcesExperience,collaborationExperience,insightsExperience,forecastExperience,roiExperience,trackerExperience,nightwatchExperience][current]();$('.headerRight').innerHTML=`<div class="presentation-bar"><span>CLIENT DEMONSTRATION</span>${btn(icon('grid')+(state.productFocus?' Show suite':' Focus on product'),'focusProduct()')}${btn(icon('help'),'productGuide()')}</div><span class="demo"><i></i> Sample data</span>`;};
function proposalExperience(){let header=expHeader(0,ib('New proposal','newProposalDialog()','plus','primary'));if(tab>0)return `<div class="experience proposal-product">${header}${secondary(0)}</div>`;return `<div class="experience proposal-product">${header}<div class="proposal-root"><div class="proposal-library">${ib('New conversation','newProposalDialog()','plus')}<h3>Recent proposals</h3><button class="local-link active" onclick="state.proposal=true;render()"><div><b>${esc(state.customProposal||'Operations modernization')}</b><small>In progress · Just now</small></div></button>${['Customer intelligence pilot','Quarterly planning platform'].map(x=>btn(`<div>${x}<small>Sample opportunity</small></div>`,`draw('${x}','<p>A sample opportunity to explore with the proposal assistant.</p>'+ib('Start a conversation',\"closeDrawer();proposalChat('Create a proposal for ${x}')\",'arrow','primary'))`,'local-link')).join('')}<h3>Company knowledge</h3>${btn(icon('file')+' Capabilities & experience',"draw('Company knowledge','<p>Nine-67 builds practical AI tools around the way a business works. Use approved case studies and capabilities as source material for a real proposal.</p>')",'local-link')}${btn(icon('file')+' Response library','tab=1;render()','local-link')}<div class="local-bottom" style="margin-top:80px">${icon('lock')} &nbsp; Private workspace<br>Supporting sources stay in context.</div></div><div class="proposal-conversation">${state.chat.length?`<div class="row" style="margin-bottom:20px"><span class="micro-label">PROPOSAL CONVERSATION</span>${tag('Drafting','amber')}</div><div class="chat" style="flex:1;min-height:350px">${state.chat.map(([r,s])=>`<div class="bubble ${r==='user'?'user':''}">${esc(s)}</div>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="welcome"><div class="seal">${icon('spark')}</div><h1>Let’s write something<br>worth saying yes to.</h1><p>Bring the opportunity. We’ll work through the questions, requirements, and response together.</p></div><div class="starters">${btn(icon('file')+'Start with an RFP<small>Map the requirements. Find the right approach.</small>',"document.getElementById('rfpfile').click()")}${btn(icon('proposal')+'Shape a new proposal<small>Start with the opportunity and your idea.</small>','newProposalDialog()')}${btn(icon('spark')+'Use a sample opportunity<small>Explore a 90-day operations pilot.</small>',"proposalChat('Help me build the Operations Modernization proposal')")}${btn(icon('check')+'Review a response<small>Check coverage, evidence, and commitments.</small>','tab=2;render()')}</div>`}<div class="inputbox"><textarea id="proposalInput" placeholder="Tell me about the opportunity, or ask a question…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'&&!event.shiftKey){event.preventDefault();proposalChat()}"></textarea><div class="row"><div>${ib('Attach RFP',"document.getElementById('rfpfile').click()",'plus')}${btn('Use sample',"state.proposal=true;proposalChat('Use the sample 90-day RFP')")}</div>${ib('Send','proposalChat()','arrow','primary')}</div><input hidden id="rfpfile" type="file" accept=".pdf,.docx,.txt" onchange="proposalUpload(this)"></div><p class="exp-note" style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px">AI response preview · Sample documents · No file contents uploaded</p></div><div class="proposal-context"><span class="micro-label">LIVE OPPORTUNITY BRIEF</span><h2 class="context-heading" style="margin:16px 0 12px">${esc(state.customProposal||'Operations Modernization')}</h2>${tag(state.proposal?'Source added':'Sample opportunity',state.proposal?'green':'')}<div class="context-stage"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>${[['Client','Sample operations team'],['Delivery window','90-day pilot'],['Budget ceiling','$75,000'],['Requirements','12 identified'],['Working document','5 planned sections']].map(([x,y])=>`<div class="context-item"><label>${x.toUpperCase()}</label><b>${y}</b></div>`).join('')}<div style="margin-top:22px">${ib('Open document studio','tab=1;render()','arrow','primary')}</div><div class="exp-tinted" style="margin-top:25px"><span class="micro-label">NEXT QUESTION</span><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:#655545">What outcome matters most to the selection team?</p></div></div></div></div>`}
function responseExperience(){let header=expHeader(1,ib('Generate sequences','state.response=true;tab=1;render()','spark','primary'));if(tab>0)return `<div class="experience response-product">${header}${secondary(1)}</div>`;return `<div class="experience response-product">${header}<div class="campaign-layout"><div class="campaign-menu"><div class="micro-label" style="margin-bottom:20px">WEBINAR CAMPAIGNS</div><button class="campaign-item selected" onclick="render()"><b>AI in Everyday Operations</b><small>October 15, 2026<br>148 registered · 112 attended</small></button>${btn('Smarter Financial Planning<small>September 24 · Archived sample</small>',"draw('Archived campaign','<p>A previous sample campaign with 96 attendees and four personalized messages per attendee.</p>')",'campaign-item')}<div class="micro-label" style="margin:29px 10px 12px">AUDIENCE</div>${['All registrants','Operations leaders','Finance leaders','Growth leaders'].map((x,i)=>btn(icon('user')+x,`audienceSegment(${i})`,'local-link')).join('')}<div class="local-bottom">A meaningful next step for every attendee.</div></div><div class="exp-body"><div class="campaign-masthead"><div><div class="exp-kicker">CAMPAIGN / OCTOBER 15, 2026</div><h1>AI in Everyday Operations</h1><p>A conversation about fewer handoffs, clearer ownership,<br>and a practical first step with AI.</p><div class="suggestions">${tag('Transcript ready','green')}${tag('Recording added')}${tag('Guide selected')}</div></div><div class="event-art">${icon('response')}<span>NINE-67 WEBINAR<br>48 minutes of practical ideas.</span></div></div><div class="campaign-overview"><section><div class="engagement-kpis">${[['Registered','148'],['Attended','112'],['High intent','38'],['Sequences',state.response?'148':'0']].map(([x,n])=>`<div><label>${x}</label><b>${n}</b></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="row"><h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0">The follow-up journey</h2>${ib('Edit cadence','state.response=true;tab=1;render()','settings')}</div><p class="exp-note">One personalized recap, followed by three useful next steps.</p><div class="sequence-horizontal">${['Webinar recap','Share something useful','Make it concrete','Start a conversation'].map((x,i)=>`<button class="${i===0?'selected':''}" onclick="state.emailDay=${i};tab=1;render()"><span class="day">DAY ${[0,3,7,14][i]}</span><b>${x}</b><small>${i===0?'Initial message':'Follow-up '+i} &nbsp; ↗</small></button>`).join('')}</div><div style="margin-top:25px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #e7dece"><div class="row"><h3 style="font-size:12px;margin:0">Content powering the conversation</h3>${ib('View transcript','transcriptDialog()','file')}</div><div class="suggestions" style="margin-top:14px">${tag('Operational handoffs')}${tag('Reporting efficiency')}${tag('Your first AI pilot')}</div><p class="exp-note">Each draft connects the webinar’s themes to the attendee’s role, questions, and engagement.</p></div></section>${surface('Audience engagement',`${[['Registered',148,100],['Attended',112,76],['Engaged',68,46],['High intent',38,26]].map(([x,n,w])=>`<div class="funnelrow"><span>${x}</span>${bar(w)}<b>${n}</b></div>`).join('')}<div class="exp-tinted" style="margin-top:20px;padding:16px"><span class="micro-label">A GOOD PLACE TO START</span><p class="exp-note" style="margin-bottom:0">38 attendees watched more than 75% or engaged directly. Review these conversations first.</p></div>`)}</div><div style="margin-top:30px">${surface('People, context, and the next step',table(['Attendee','Company','Engagement','Intent',''],people.map((p,i)=>[`<div class="person">${ava(p[0])}<div><b>${p[0]}</b><small>${p[1]}</small></div></div>`,p[2],p[4],`<div class="audience-score"><i></i>${p[3]}</div>`,ib('Open sequence',`state.selectedPerson=${i};tab=1;render()`,'arrow')])))}<p class="exp-note">Sample audience data · Sequences require review · No emails are sent</p></div></div></div></div>`}
function transcriptDialog(){draw('Webinar context',`<span class="sourcebadge">AI IN EVERYDAY OPERATIONS</span>${[['03:24','Start with one repeated workflow','Measure how much time a recurring handoff takes before deciding what to automate.'],['18:10','Bring ownership into view','A shared view of project status, exceptions, and next actions helps teams coordinate.'],['36:45','Build a focused first iteration','A two-week milestone gives a team something concrete to test and improve.']].map(([t,h,p])=>`<div class="listitem"><span class="micro-label">${t}</span><h3 style="margin:10px 0">${h}</h3><p class="muted">${p}</p></div>`).join('')}<div class="exp-note">Illustrative transcript context for this campaign.</div>`)}
function triageExperience(){return `<div class="experience triage-product">${expHeader(2,ib('Import leads','importLeadsDialog()','plus','primary'))}${secondary(2)}</div>`}
function simulationExperience(){let header=expHeader(3,ib('Run focus group','runPanelSaaS()','spark','primary'));if(tab>0)return `<div class="experience simulation-product">${header}${secondary(3)}</div>`;return `<div class="experience simulation-product">${header}<div class="sim-canvas"><div class="sim-left"><div class="exp-kicker">YOUR IDEA, BEFORE IT MEETS THE WORLD</div><h1>Put it in front of the room.<br>Before it’s real.</h1><p class="subtitle">Explore how different decision-makers might react.<br>Find the questions, friction, and stronger next version.</p><div class="workshop-panel"><div class="row"><span class="micro-label">THE IDEA ON THE TABLE</span><select aria-label="Content type" style="width:150px;font-size:10px;padding:8px" onchange="state.simMode=this.value;persist()">${['Proposal / pitch','Marketing message','Product concept','Strategy'].map(s=>`<option ${state.simMode===s?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><textarea id="simtext" oninput="state.simcontent=this.value;persist()" placeholder="Paste the message, concept, or proposal you want to test…">${esc(state.simcontent)}</textarea><div class="row" style="border-top:1px solid #e9e1d4;padding-top:17px"><span class="exp-note">Be specific. Give the room something to react to.</span>${ib('Run analysis','runPanelSaaS()','spark','primary')}</div></div><div class="sim-room">${panelNames.map((x,i)=>`<div class="portrait" style="opacity:${state.simPersonas[i]?1:.2};background:${['#d5c2a0','#bccbc1','#c5c6d4','#dfc7ba','#cecbbb'][i]}">${['AM','JE','TK','SR','CL'][i]}</div>`).join('')}</div><div class="sim-room-caption">${state.simPersonas.filter(Boolean).length} perspectives. A more complete conversation.</div><p class="exp-note" style="text-align:center;margin-top:23px">Simulated AI feedback is directional—not a substitute for real audience research.</p></div><div class="sim-right"><div class="row"><h2 style="font-size:15px;margin:0">Build your room</h2>${tag('5 personas')}</div><p class="exp-note">Choose the perspectives you need to hear.</p><label class="field" style="margin:25px 0 10px">Industry context<select onchange="state.simIndustry=this.value;persist()">${['Professional services','Manufacturing','Financial services','Healthcare'].map(x=>`<option ${state.simIndustry===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>${panelNames.map((x,i)=>`<div class="sim-persona"><div class="portrait" style="background:${['#d5c2a0','#bccbc1','#c5c6d4','#dfc7ba','#cecbbb'][i]}">${['AM','JE','TK','SR','CL'][i]}</div><div><b>${x}</b><small>${['Strategic fit & business outcomes','Cost, evidence & value','Data, access & implementation','Daily benefit & team adoption','Scope, risk & accountability'][i]}</small></div><input class="rowcheck" type="checkbox" aria-label="Include ${x}" ${state.simPersonas[i]?'checked':''} onchange="state.simPersonas[${i}]=this.checked;render()"></div>`).join('')}<div class="exp-tinted" style="margin-top:25px"><span class="micro-label">WHAT COMES BACK</span><p class="exp-note">Individual reactions, common objections, suggested changes, and a side-by-side comparison after you refine.</p></div></div></div></div>`}
function budgetExperience(){let header=expHeader(4,ib('Review plan','tab=2;render()','arrow','primary'),ib('Export','exportBudgetSaas()','download','secondary-action'));if(tab===2)return `<div class="experience budget-product">${header}${secondary(4)}</div>`;let total=state.budget.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0),depts=['Operations','Marketing','Technology','People'],viewTotal=tab===0?total:state.budget[state.budgetDept],viewPrior=tab===0?340000:[160000,80000,55000,45000][state.budgetDept];return `<div class="experience budget-product">${header}<div class="budget-workbook"><div class="budget-departments"><div class="local-label">FY 2027 WORKBOOK</div>${btn(icon('budget')+' Company plan','tab=0;render()','local-link '+(tab===0?'active':''))}<div class="local-label" style="margin-top:22px">DEPARTMENTS</div>${depts.map((x,i)=>btn(icon('file')+x,`state.budgetDept=${i};tab=1;render()`,'local-link '+(tab===1&&state.budgetDept===i?'active':''))).join('')}<div class="local-bottom">Planning cycle<br>Department → Finance → Leadership</div></div><div class="budget-sheetarea"><div class="budget-finance-top"><div><h1>${tab===0?'Company operating plan':depts[state.budgetDept]+' plan'}</h1><p>Fiscal year 2027 · USD · Working version</p></div><div class="budget-finance-summary"><div><small>Annual plan</small><b>${money(viewTotal)}</b></div><div><small>Prior year</small><b>${money(viewPrior)}</b></div><div><small>Variance</small><b>+${((viewTotal/viewPrior-1)*100).toFixed(1)}%</b></div></div></div><div class="sheettoolbar"><span class="sourcebadge">F4</span><span style="font-family:Georgia;font-style:italic;color:#849468">ƒx</span><span style="font-size:10px;color:#96a183">Annual plan = Q1 + Q2 + Q3 + Q4</span><span style="margin-left:auto">${ib('Comments','budgetCommentsDialog()','file')}</span></div><div class="spreadsheet"><table><thead><tr><th>Account / department</th><th>Prior year</th><th>Q1</th><th>Q2</th><th>Q3</th><th>Q4</th><th>Annual plan</th><th>Δ</th></tr></thead><tbody>${(tab===0?depts:[depts[state.budgetDept]]).map((d,j)=>{let i=tab===0?j:state.budgetDept;return `<tr class="group"><td>${btn('▾ '+d,`state.budgetDept=${i};tab=1;render()`,'link')}</td><td>${money([160000,80000,55000,45000][i])}</td>${[.22,.24,.26,.28].map(n=>`<td>${money(state.budget[i]*n)}</td>`).join('')}<td><input aria-label="${d} annual budget" type="number" min="0" value="${state.budget[i]}" onchange="state.budget[${i}]=Math.max(0,+this.value);render()"></td><td>${((state.budget[i]/[160000,80000,55000,45000][i]-1)*100).toFixed(1)}%</td></tr>${['People & delivery','Tools & infrastructure','Contingency'].map((n,k)=>`<tr><td style="padding-left:28px;color:#a1aa91">${n}</td><td>—</td>${[.22,.24,.26,.28].map(q=>`<td>${money(state.budget[i]*q*[.65,.25,.1][k])}</td>`).join('')}<td>${money(state.budget[i]*[.65,.25,.1][k])}</td><td>—</td></tr>`).join('')}`}).join('')}<tr class="total"><td>${tab===0?'Total company plan':depts[state.budgetDept]+' subtotal'}</td><td>${money(viewPrior)}</td>${[.22,.24,.26,.28].map(q=>`<td>${money(viewTotal*q)}</td>`).join('')}<td>${money(viewTotal)}</td><td>${((viewTotal/viewPrior-1)*100).toFixed(1)}%</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="budget-assistantbar"><div><div class="row"><h2>Plan with your AI partner</h2>${icon('spark')}</div><div class="bubble">Operations drives the largest increase. Try adjusting a department by a percentage and see the workbook recalculate.</div><div id="budgetReply"></div><div class="composer"><input id="budgetAsk" placeholder="Reduce operations by 5%…" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')budgetAsk()">${ib('','budgetAsk()','arrow','primary')}</div></div><div><h2>Try a planning scenario</h2><p class="exp-note">Explore changes before committing the plan.</p><div class="suggestions">${btn('Operations −5%','state.budget[0]=Math.round(state.budget[0]*.95);render()')}${btn('Technology +10%','state.budget[2]=Math.round(state.budget[2]*1.1);render()')}</div><div class="metadata"><div><label>REVIEW OWNER</label><b>Jordan Ellis · Finance</b></div><div><label>PLAN STATUS</label><b>${state.budgetSubmitted?'Submitted':'Working draft'}</b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>`}
function salesRevenueChart(){let vals=state.quarter==='Q3 2026'?[1.3,1.7,1.55,2.1,2.2,2.5,2.3,2.7,3.42]:[1.5,1.7,1.8,2.15,2.1,2.7,2.55,2.95,3.1,3.5,3.65,3.84];let coords=vals.map((n,i)=>`${45+i*(570/(vals.length-1))},${235-n*45}`).join(' ');return `<svg viewBox="0 0 660 280" class="chart" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative monthly revenue in millions"><defs><linearGradient id="revenueFill" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#a6b18c" stop-opacity=".22"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#a6b18c" stop-opacity=".02"/></linearGradient></defs>${[1,2,3,4].map(n=>`<line x1="42" x2="635" y1="${235-n*45}" y2="${235-n*45}" stroke="#eaeade"/><text x="0" y="${239-n*45}" fill="#a5a38d" font-size="10">$${n}M</text>`).join('')}<polygon points="45,235 ${coords} 615,235" fill="url(#revenueFill)"/><polyline points="45,185 97,180 149,173 201,166 253,159 305,153 357,144 409,137 461,130 513,125 565,118 615,111" stroke="#d5d1bd" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 5" fill="none"/><polyline points="${coords}" fill="none" stroke="#88996b" stroke-width="3"/>${vals.map((n,i)=>`<circle cx="${45+i*(570/(vals.length-1))}" cy="${235-n*45}" r="3.5" fill="white" stroke="#88996b" stroke-width="2"><title>${n.toFixed(2)} million dollars</title></circle>`).join('')}${['Jan','Mar','May','Jul','Sep','Dec'].map((x,i)=>`<text x="${45+i*114}" y="265" fill="#aaa48d" font-size="10">${x}</text>`).join('')}</svg>`}
function salesExperience(){let head=expHeader(5,ib('Export','exportSales()','download','primary'));if(tab===1)return `<div class="experience sales-product">${head}${secondary(5)}</div>`;return `<div class="experience sales-product">${head}<div class="exp-body"><div class="sales-masthead"><div><div class="exp-kicker">REVENUE INTELLIGENCE</div><h1>Performance. Pipeline. Perspective.</h1><p>A clear view of where the quarter stands—and what could change it.</p></div><select aria-label="Quarter" style="width:135px;font-size:11px" onchange="state.quarter=this.value;render()">${['Q4 2026','Q3 2026'].map(x=>`<option ${state.quarter===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="sales-metrics">${[['Revenue',state.quarter==='Q4 2026'?'$3.84M':'$3.42M','↑ 12.3% vs previous quarter'],['Weighted pipeline','$2.16M','18 open opportunities'],['Win rate','32%','↑ 4 points vs last year'],['Average sales cycle','42 days','↓ 6 days vs last quarter']].map(([x,n,s])=>`<div class="sales-metric"><small>${x}</small><strong>${n}</strong><span>${s}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="sales-layout">${surface('Revenue performance',`<div class="row"><div class="chartlegend"><span><i style="background:#88996b"></i>Current year</span><span><i style="background:#d5d1bd"></i>Prior year</span></div>${tag('USD millions')}</div>${salesRevenueChart()}<div class="row exp-note"><span>Monthly performance · Illustrative data</span><span>12-month view</span></div>`,ib('Model outlook','nav(9)','arrow','link'))}${surface('Opportunity conversion',`<div class="row" style="margin:0 0 22px"><div><span class="micro-label">TOTAL PIPELINE</span><div style="font-size:28px;font-weight:500;margin-top:9px;color:#746342">$6.75M</div></div>${tag('3.2× coverage','green')}</div><div class="pipeline-funnel"><div><span>Qualified</span><b>32%</b></div><div><span>Discovery</span><b>27%</b></div><div><span>Proposal</span><b>24%</b></div><div><span>Negotiation</span><b>17%</b></div></div><p class="exp-note" style="margin:8px 0 0">Two late-stage opportunities account for 41% of weighted pipeline.</p>`,ib('Open deals','tab=1;render()','arrow','link'))}</div><div class="sales-secondary">${surface('Revenue by segment',`${[['Professional services',1.62,84],['Manufacturing',1.14,59],['Financial services',.76,39],['Other',.32,17]].map(([x,n,w])=>`<div class="metricline"><span>${x}</span><b>$${n.toFixed(2)}M</b></div><div class="bar" style="height:8px"><i style="width:${w}%;background:${x==='Manufacturing'?'#b6a074':'#b2bb98'}"></i></div>`).join('')}`)}${surface('The deals that could move the quarter',table(['Opportunity','Value','Stage',''],state.deals.slice(0,3).map((d,i)=>[`<b>${d.company}</b><small>${d.name}</small>`,money(d.value),tag(d.stage,d.stage==='Negotiation'?'green':'amber'),ib('','editDealSaas('+i+')','chevron')])) )}</div>${tab===2?`<div class="exp-tinted" style="margin-top:24px"><div class="row"><div><h3 style="font-size:14px">What happens if conversion improves?</h3><p class="exp-note">Use the forecasting workspace to test pipeline growth and win rate against the baseline.</p></div>${ib('Explore the model','nav(9)','arrow','primary')}</div></div>`:''}</div></div>`}
function resourcesExperience(){let total=state.team.reduce((s,t)=>s+t[2],0),over=state.team.filter(t=>t[2]>40).length;return `<div class="experience resource-product">${expHeader(6,ib('AI rebalance','rebalanceDialog()','spark','primary'))}<div class="planner-summary"><span><b>${Math.round(total/200*100)}%</b>scheduled utilization</span><span><b>${over}</b>over capacity</span><span><b>${Math.max(0,200-total)} hrs</b>unallocated</span><span style="margin-left:auto">${tag('Weekly delivery plan')}</span></div><div class="exp-body">${saasViews[6]()}</div></div>`}
function collaborationExperience(){return `<div class="experience collab-product"><div class="collab-projecttop"><div class="topline"><div class="project-title"><span>${icon('collab')}</span><div><h1>Operations modernization</h1><p>Nine-67 / Collaboration Workspace / Project home</p></div></div><div class="righttools"><div class="stackedavatars">${ava('Alex Morgan')}${ava('Taylor Kim')}${ava('Morgan Hayes')}</div></div></div><div class="tabsline">${expMenu[7].map((x,i)=>btn(x,`tab=${i};render()`,tab===i?'active':'')).join('')}<span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;color:#a4ac92">● &nbsp; Project on track</span></div></div>${saasViews[7]()}</div>`}
function insightsExperience(){let extras=`<div class="local-label">BUSINESS FUNCTIONS</div>${[['Revenue',5],['Delivery',11],['Finance',4],['Marketing',1]].map(([x,i])=>btn(icon(productIcons[i])+x,`nav(${i})`,'local-link')).join('')}<div class="local-label">DATA & CONTEXT</div>${btn(icon('link')+' Connected sources','reportSourcesDialog()','local-link')}${btn(icon('spark')+' Ask across reports','askReports()','local-link')}`;return `<div class="experience insights-product"><div class="exp-vertical">${localNav(8,extras,true)}<div><div class="exp-toolbar"><div class="left"><span class="label">${expMenu[8][tab]}</span><span class="sep"></span><span class="exp-note">All business functions</span></div><div class="right">${ib('Sources','reportSourcesDialog()','link')}${ib('Ask insights','askReports()','spark','primary')}</div></div>${saasViews[8]()}</div></div></div>`}
function forecastExperience(){return `<div class="experience forecast-product">${expHeader(9,ib('Save scenario','saveScenario()','plus','primary'),ib('Scenarios','forecastLibrary()','file','secondary-action'))}${saasViews[9]()}</div>`}
function roiExperience(){return `<div class="experience roi-product">${expHeader(10,ib('Export case','exportRoi2()','download','primary'),ib('Methodology','roiMethodology()','help','secondary-action'))}<div class="exp-body">${saasViews[10]()}</div></div>`}
function trackerExperience(){let extras=`<div class="local-label">PORTFOLIO VIEWS</div>${btn(icon('check')+' On track','state.projectFilter="On track";tab=0;render()','local-link')}${btn(icon('clock')+' Needs attention','state.projectFilter="Needs attention";tab=0;render()','local-link')}<div class="local-label">PROGRAM</div>${btn(icon('spark')+' Portfolio briefing','portfolioBrief()','local-link')}${btn(icon('roi')+' Business cases','nav(10)','local-link')}`;if(!state.individualTrackerInitialized){state.projectView='list';state.individualTrackerInitialized=true}return `<div class="experience tracker-product"><div class="exp-vertical">${localNav(11,extras)}<div><div class="exp-toolbar"><div class="left"><span class="label">Nine-67 delivery portfolio</span><span class="sep"></span>${tag((projects.length+(state.newProjects||[]).length)+' initiatives')}</div><div class="right">${ib('New initiative','newProjectDialog()','plus','primary')}</div></div><div class="tracker-summary"><h1>${expMenu[11][tab]}</h1><p>Every build, milestone, and decision. One shared source of progress.</p></div>${saasViews[11]()}</div></div></div>`}
function nightwatchExperience(){return `<div class="experience night-product">${expHeader(12,ib('Run research','state.night=true;render();toast("Sample research run complete")','refresh','primary'))}${saasViews[12]()}</div>`}
